    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d315">

                <pb facs="0583" n="563" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg563"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 21, 1864</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    lordship that Commander Rolando is supposed to be on his Way north, and that
                    when he arrives, inquiry will be made of him in regard to the authenticity of
                    the intercepted letter, a copy of which accompanied your note of the 4th
                    instant, respecting the case of the Sir William Peel.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
